<h1>Gecko-Inspired Material FTIR Measurement</h1>
<p class="lead">Experimental work involving FTIR-based measurement of contact area for a gecko-inspired material.</p>
</section>
<section class="page-shell detail-layout">
<div class="detail-copy">
<h2>Project overview</h2>
<p>This project investigates the use of a measurement setup based on frustrated total internal reflection (FTIR) to observe contact between a gecko-inspired material and a transparent surface.</p>
<h2>Engineering activities</h2>
<ul class="clean-list">
<li>Work with an FTIR-based experimental measurement approach.</li>
<li>Capture images of the contact interface.</li>
<li>Explore image processing to identify and measure the contact area.</li>
</ul>

</div>
